OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with early mist or fog
OL,6,Fin the glens. A mostly dry day with
OL,7,Fincreasing bright or sunny spells
OL,8,Funtil cloud spreads into the north
OL,9,Flater.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with the chance of an
OL,12,Fodd shower in the north at first
OL,13,Fotherwise mostly dry with clear
OL,14,Fspells. Frosty with mist or fog
OL,15,Fpatches later.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FMostly dry and bright
OL,18,Fbecoming cloudy in the north later
OL,19,Fwith blustery, locally heavy and
OL,20,Fwintry showers in the far north
OL,21,Ftowards the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
