OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FCold
OL,6,Fwith blustery and wintry showers in
OL,7,Fthe north Thursday. Less cold and
OL,8,Fmostly dry but cloudy Friday. Dry at
OL,9,Ffirst, rain south later Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
